title: FaustEventStart
---
Faust messaged you to meet him at the gym. He said it was about
training.

That wasn't unusual, so you went.

The gym doors creaked as you pushed them open.

Inside, it was empty.

No team. No coach.

Just Faust.

He stood in the center of the mat, back turned.

You: "Faust?"

He turned slowly.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool true>>

Faust: "{$playerName}, good. You're here,"

His tone was calm. Too calm.

You stepped closer, uneasy.

You: "Where is everyone?"

Faust smiled faintly.

Faust: "I told them not to come,"

Your stomach dropped.

You: "Why?"

He exhaled, like this was obvious.

Faust: "Because I needed to deal with something,"

Silence hung between you.

You: "Deal with what?"

His eyes locked onto you.

Faust: "You,"

Your breath caught.

You: "What are you talking about?"

He tilted his head, studying you.

Faust: "You've improved faster than expected,"

Faust: "Your stance, your reactions...your timing,"

His tone was analytical. Detached.

Faust: "You're becoming a problem,"

You took a step back.

You: "A problem?"

He stepped forward.

Faust: "I don't lose, {$playerName},"

His smile didn't reach his eyes.

Faust: "I can't afford to,"

You: "This isn't a competition like that—"

Faust: "Everything is,"

He cut you off instantly.

Faust: "Matches, rankings, attention...control,"

Another step closer.

Faust: "You're getting in the way of that,"

Your pulse spiked.

You: "So what? You're going to scare me off?"

He laughed softly.

Faust: "If that worked, I wouldn't be doing this,"

His stance lowered slightly.

Familiar.

Like a match.

Faust: "You keep coming back,"

Faust: "So I'll make sure you can't,"

Your body tensed.

You: "Faust, stop—"

He moved.

Fast.

Faust: "Show me how far you've come,"

He lunged.

<<setBool FaustDiaImageBool false>>
<<startEventGame>>
===

title: PlayerWinsEvent
---
Faust hit the mat hard.

The impact echoed through the empty gym.

You staggered back, breathing heavily.

You had won.

For a moment, there was only silence.

Faust lay still.

Then he laughed.

Faust: "Heh...so you actually did it, {$playerName},"

He pushed himself up slowly, wincing.

Faust: "Guess I miscalculated,"

You: "This is over, Faust,"

He looked up at you.

For the first time, he didn’t look in control.

Faust: "Over?"

He wiped blood from his lip, smiling faintly.

Faust: "No...not quite,"

You tensed, but he didn’t move.

Faust: "You beat me. Fair and square,"

His voice was quieter now.

Faust: "So what now?"

He met your eyes.

Faust: "Are you going to end it?"

Your heart pounded.

Faust: "Or are you going to hesitate?"

Silence stretched between you.

-> Show mercy
    <<jump MercyEnd>>
-> Finish him off
    <<jump FinishEnd>>
===

title: PlayerLosesEvent
---
Your back hit the mat.

Hard.

The air left your lungs in one sharp gasp.

Before you could recover, Faust was on you.

Pinning you down.

You struggled, but it was useless.

He was stronger.

Faster.

Better.

Faust: "I told you, {$playerName},"

His voice was calm again.

Controlled.

Faust: "I don't lose,"

You tried to push him off.

He didn’t budge.

Faust: "You improved too quickly,"

Faust: "That made you dangerous,"

Your vision blurred.

Faust leaned closer.

Faust: "I can't have that,"

You: "Faust...
You: "....s-...stop..."

He smiled. Satisfied, and sure in his actions...

Faust: "You should've stayed out of it,"
<<playSoundEffect "hurtSound">>

Faust: "This is just how it has to be,"
<<playSoundEffect "hurtSound">>

Your body went still...

Faust: "Goodbye, {$playerName}..."
<<playSoundEffect "hurtSound">>
<<loadScene "Murdered">>
===

title: MercyEnd
---

You: "...Stay down...I'm gonna call an ambulance..."

You say with a hint of bitter resignation.
But you weren't a murderer, even being attacked
wasn't gonna change that for you. 
That was something Faust couldn't understand.

Faust: "Wh-..."
Faust: "What?..."
Faust: "You're-...an idiot..."

You ignored him, took out your phone and 
dialed for an ambulance.

Faust: "...Why didn't you take the chance?..."
Faust: "...What have you possibly achieved with MERCY!?..."

You sigh and thank the operator as they assures you 
someone is on their way. Wiping some blood from your 
own nose, you turned to look down at him. 

You: "...Your life, Faust."
<<loadScene "Graduation">>
===

title: FinishEnd
---
<<playSoundEffect "hurtSound">>
...
<<playSoundEffect "hurtSound">>
...
<<playSoundEffect "hurtSound">>
...

You watched the red pool grow larger around his head.
You foot having crushed his skull against the ground.
His pulse stopped, his eyes closed, and at last...

Faust lost. 
<<updateInt "endingNumber" 1>>
<<loadScene "Graduation">>
===
